[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チッ……今日はダメだ……\nロクなのが居やしねえ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch... No luck today either... There's nobody worth taking..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あのわがまま王妃め……\n次々注文を付けてきやがって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That damn demanding queen... She keeps piling on more and more orders."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その分報酬は弾んでもらわねえと、\nまったく割に合わねえってんだ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She'd better pay up for all this hassle... This is way more trouble than it's worth...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……誰だ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Who's there?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出てきやがれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Show yourself!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！\u3000爆弾！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A bomb?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のは音だけのオモチャだ。何者だお前",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was just a noise toy. Now who the hell are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの、私は諸島同盟の監察官です。\n「ヌルスラの鷹」という賞金首を探しています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm an inspector with the Archipelago Federation. I'm searching for a wanted criminal known as the \"Hawk of Nurslath.\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう、ぽやっとした嬢ちゃんが監察官。\nそれは見抜けなかったぜ。なんで俺をつけてた？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh. A spaced-out little girl like you is an inspector? Didn't see that coming. Why were you tailing me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あなたの歩き方です。\n最初は変な歩き方をしてるなって思っただけでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It was the way you walk. At first I just thought you had an odd gait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、思い出したんです。あれは、ぬかるみを\n歩くときの歩き方……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But then I remembered. That's how you walk through muddy ground..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっとあなたは長年ぬかるんだ地面を歩き続けて、\nその歩き方が染みついてしまったんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You must have spent years walking across muddy terrain until it became second nature."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たとえば……湿地の多い、ヌルスラの地面のような",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like, for instance... the marshy ground of Nurslath."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たったそれだけで犯罪者扱いってか？\nそんなの言い掛かりなんじゃねえか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're treating me like a criminal over just that? Sounds like you're grasping at straws."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最初はただの勘でしたけど……\n今はより疑いが強まりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At first it was just a hunch, but... now I'm much more certain."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただの護身用だよ。\nそんなもの、なんの証拠にも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's just for self-defense. That's hardly proof of—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ、昔ヌルスラの闇市で見かけたことがあります。\n爆弾を模したオモチャ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've seen these before. Back in Nurslath's black market. Toys made to look like bombs..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ、同盟への加入をきっかけに、\nその手の闇市は一掃されたはず。なぜあなたがこれを？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But when we joined the Federation, those black markets were all shut down. So why would you have one?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなものどこにだってある。\nどうしても俺をヌルスラと結び付けてえようだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These things are everywhere. You're really trying to pin Nurslath on me, but—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……インクのにじみ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...The ink is smudged."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヌルスラは貧しい島です。\nなんにだってお金をケチります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nurslath is a poor island. We cut corners on everything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから商品に使われるインクだって安物。\nちょっと雑に扱っただけですぐにじんじゃう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even the ink used for products is cheap. Handle it a little roughly and it smudges right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな安物のインクを使ってるの、\nヌルスラで作られたもの以外にありませんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Only things made in Nurslath use such cheap ink."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "適当言ってんじゃねえ！\nんなの、一目で分かるわけがねえだろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't give me that crap! There's no way you could tell that just by looking!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かりますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can tell."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、私も昔ヌルスラで、\nそんな商品を作ってたんですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because I used to make products like this back in Nurslath myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……面白え。\nあんた、いい勘してるぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Heh. Interesting. You've got good instincts, kid."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "目つきの悪い男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suspicious Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ、やっぱりあなたは……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you really are...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]